      "content": "Atmospheric conditions and ionospheric interference cannot carry human-designed data transmissions through the air to specific locations; distant satellites only reach Earth via line-of-sight into space, and natural ionospheric noise lacks the structure to form coherent signals. What you are likely experiencing is probably a specific resonant frequency of your building's HVAC system, plumbing, or electrical wiring exacerbated by power fluctuations or humidity changes. If the pattern feels structured and persists despite explaining away environmental factors, it is often more psychological in origin, such as hypnagogic jellies or hyperacusis, than evidence of external transmission.",
